        "text": "t27c reads a spec in stages. The lexer cuts the text into tokens. The parser builds a syntax tree. The type checker checks every width and every call. The tree is lowered to HIR, a simpler form, and each backend writes code from it. This widget runs those stages on a spec in your browser and shows what each one produced, so an error has a stage you can point at.",
